@startuml

participant "Relying Party" as RP
participant "Verifier (IdP)" as IdP

autonumber 1 1 "<b>[00]"

RP -> IdP: <wst:RequestSecurityToken/Renew> [SOAP]
IdP -> IdP: Check previous SAML token
IdP -> IdP: Generate new SAML token
IdP -> RP: <wst:RequestSecurityTokenResponse> [SOAP]

autonumber stop

@enduml
